bcQlpGuSif-XfUTqES8oi1-pcsHpG_RRsDYQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfwzvX3v7iQJng_0B55oGbUAgfoS98LKhrrhbGdATwpSFA&oe=69C3EE64"}, "display_name": "RC Brains: Vehicle Possession Sandbox", "keywords": ["racing", "socialvr", "rccars", "vehicles", "cars"], "long_description": "RC Brains is a fast-paced social VR game where you collect, customize, and race RC vehicles as a Brain \ud83e\udde0\ud83c\udfce\ufe0f\n\nRC Brains has an Active Content Creator Program! You can join Discord to get your CC Badges! =>\n\nhttps://discord.gg/bdmxcFUTZ4\n\n{1668544704321624}\n\nEarn Brain Bits \ud83d\udc8e to unlock rewards and upgrades:\n\n\u2022 Unlock new RC vehicles \ud83d\ude97\n\n\u2022 Collect cosmetics and skins\n\n\u2022 Earn seasonal rewards\n\n\u2022 Perform jumps, flips, and drifts\n\n\u2022 Race friends in competitive matches \ud83c\udfc1\n\n\u2022 Hang out in casual social modes\n\n\n\n\nRC Brains is being developed by a solo creator known as Dev Brain, who builds the game with direct input from players.\n\n\n\n\n\nNew updates, including cars, tracks, quests, and community-requested features, are coming every week!\n{1608769156981611}\n", "short_description": "RC Brains is a Social VR racing game for Meta Quest where players play as Brains with Gorilla Tag-style locomotion. \n\nSet in a cozy suburban simulation, Brains race and hustle to EARN Races, Brain Bits, Brain Cups, and, of course, RESPECT! "}]}, "developer_name": "AshRift Studios", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.rcbrains.com/privacy_policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.rcbrains.com/terms", "publisher_name": "AshRift Studios", "support_website_url": "https://www.rcbrains.com/", "website_url": "https://www.rcbrains.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "673385183287495"}, {"id": "2776542286000603"}, {